  "question": {
    "text": "If for the series $a_1, a_2, a_3, \\ldots$. etc, $a_r-a_{r+1}$ bears a constant ratio with $a_r a_{r+1} ;$ then $a_1, a_2, a_3 \\ldots$. are in",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
