  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Hint: $\\frac{a_{\\mathrm{r}}-a_{r+1}}{a_{\\mathrm{r}} a_{r+1}}=K($ constant$) \\Rightarrow \\frac{1}{a_{\\mathrm{r}+1}}-\\frac{1}{a_{\\mathrm{r}}}=K \\quad \\therefore \\frac{1}{a_1}, \\frac{1}{a_2}, \\frac{1}{a_3}, \\ldots \\ldots$. is an A.P $\\Rightarrow a_1, a_2, a_3, \\ldots$ is a H.P",
